div.note:
The h and i are connected by rounded closure symbols. The errata list for the Egoist Press edition (BL 57356-28; 
                        JJA
                     12, 203) indeed indicates: “for march ing read marching”. On the second set of these errata, Weaver has added by hand: “divide A//catalectic better: more space” (BL 57356-32; 
                        JJA
                     12, 210). The two corrections to the line “A catalectic tetrameter of iambs marching” in the “Proteus” episode were added to the list of “Additional corrections” included in the fourth edition of Ulysses (JJA 12: 218).
